<title>USA: Portsmouth Bank Shares sets special div.</title>
<headline>Portsmouth Bank Shares sets special div.</headline>
<dateline>PORTSMOUTH, N.H. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portsmouth Bank Shares Inc said Monday it declared a special dividend of $0.25 per share in addition to its regular $0.15 per share quarterly dividend.</p>
<p>The company said both dividends will be payable on December 15 to shareholders of record December 1.</p>
